      "text": "Body measurements\n  + Ease allowances\n  + Design intent\n          ↓\n  PATTERN (flat paper/card templates)\n          ↓\n  FABRIC CUTTING (pattern pieces → fabric panels)\n          ↓\n  ASSEMBLY (panels sewn in sequence)\n          ↓\n  3D GARMENT that fits a body"
    },
    {
