      },
      "text": "THE CORE PROBLEM:\n    Human body = 3D compound-curved surface\n    Woven fabric = 2D flat sheet (no inherent stretch)\n    SOLUTION: Darts + seams + ease encode 3D shape into flat pieces"
    },
    {
      "id": "10-PATTERN-MAKING.md#006",
      "path": [
        "10-PATTERN-MAKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:textiles:10-pattern-making, git-history:textiles:10-pattern-making]",
