      "text": "DRAFTING A SLOPER:\n    1. Take body measurements (bust/waist/hip/back length/\n       armhole depth/shoulder width/sleeve length...)\n    2. Apply drafting formulas (e.g., bust circumference/2 +\n       1.5\" = half-chest measurement on pattern)\n    3. Add wearing ease per garment type\n    4. Draw block using rulers and curved rulers\n    5. Verify by making toile (muslin mockup) → adjust"
